{"overview":"شِن‌چان، پسر همسایه، فاجعهٔ در حال حرکت است و هر جا می‌رود، هرج‌ومرج ایجاد می‌کند. با بدن یک کودک و ذهن یک بزرگسال، شِن‌چان بیش از هر کودک دیگری، آشوب می‌سازد. این کودک پنج‌ساله بی‌خیال، خوشبین و برای همه چیز هیجان‌زده است و دوست دارد کارها را به‌صورت خودش انجام دهد.","tagline":"","overview_en":"Shin-chan, the boy next door, is a walking disaster, creating chaos wherever he goes. With the body of a child and the mind of an adult, Shinchan is wreaking more havoc than any child before. Shin-chan is carefree, optimistic and gets excited about everything. This 5 year-old likes to do things his way.","tagline_en":"","runtime":24,"status":"Returning Series","seasons":[{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":2484,"y":1992,"poster":"/7qJEhLlky9aZq0LdkXt98YLbITI.jpg"}],"episodes":2484,"crew":[],"crew_en":[],"countries":["JP"],"cast":[{"name":"矢島晶子","role":"Shinnosuke Nohara (voice)","photo":"/7b9jO2IYcSpBQRcmhXnlOIgwmRI.jpg","en":"Akiko Yajima"},{"name":"میکی ناراهاشی","role":"Misae Nohara (voice)","photo":"/wxiSwjEDMjgRH41PUiGzLplTBqA.jpg","en":"Miki Narahashi"},{"name":"کیجی فوجیوارا","role":"Hiroshi Nohara (voice)","photo":"/hbfBiFiEvD8u3vikl6hUNLKF7Lv.jpg","en":"Keiji Fujiwara"},{"name":"こおろぎさとみ","role":"Himawari Nohara (voice)","photo":"/zNJyGVOJQULuyO0isN8sTVwPaX0.jpg","en":"Satomi Korogi"},{"name":"真柴摩利","role":"Shiro / Toru Kazama (voice)","photo":"/RlkauVMbIofwYvwM9j5Hbb6SyJ.jpg","en":"Mari Mashiba"},{"name":"佐藤智恵","role":"Bo-chan (voice)","photo":"/x6A6uWJUI8HnhaYVXVZJKT2EA0r.jpg","en":"Chie Sato"},{"name":"納谷六朗","role":"Bunta Takakura (voice)","photo":"/8mRUsy6nPOPEkbqfZ0HsaCj9U7N.jpg","en":"Rokuro Naya"},{"name":"富沢美智恵","role":"Ume Matsuzaka (voice)","photo":"/42Au1FT7mGOghHcrlX8g44v6dTG.jpg","en":"Michie Tomizawa"},{"name":"一龍斎貞友","role":"Masao Sato (voice)","photo":"/23NrErvp0tFXWJxKMumfDKhR0Ms.jpg","en":"Teiyu Ichiryusai"},{"name":"高田由美","role":"Midori Ishizaka (voice)","photo":"/AbQMxvbJesosIIU0zw53tgZLIFM.jpg","en":"Yumi Takada"},{"name":"林玉緒","role":"Nene S